# Cached/intermediate notebook outputs (SISR fit results, per-subject EEG data,
# intermediate figures) -- these get large (1GB+) and every fit_*/load_* helper
# in the figure4/figure5 notebooks already regenerates its own cache on a
# cache miss. Rather than ship any of it, a fresh clone is expected to
# re-run the notebooks and regenerate everything locally.
notebooks/output/

# OS/editor junk
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
